<title>UK: DG Hypo sets 500 mln mark bond due October 1999.</title>
<headline>DG Hypo sets 500 mln mark bond due October 1999.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following fungible pfandbrief</p>
<p>was announced by joint lead managers Deutsche</p>
<p>Genossenschaftsbank, Bayerische Hypotheken- und Wechsel-Bank AG</p>
<p>and Commerzbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DG HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.00	MATURITY    07.OCT.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.0475  PAY DATE    =d.mmm.yr</p>
<p> FULL FEES  18.75 PFENNIG			SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES	THE NEW TRANCHE IS DESIGNED TO BE FUNGIBLE WITH THE</p>
<p>	     EXISTING 1.0 BILLION OFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF REIHE</p>
<p>	     745, LAUNCHED ON 25.SEP.96</p>
<p>-------------------- FIXED-RATE 2ND TAKE ----------------------</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    =	   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  =	   FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    =	   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    =	   SELL CONC  =	   PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND =</p>
<p> NOTES	=</p>
<p> LISTING    FFURT     DENOMS (K) ONE	 GOV LAW    GERMAN</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 PFENNIG SELL CONC  13.75 PFENNIG</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
